(; constants used by Mathlib.Data.Nat.Prime.Infinite, declared with their translated types ;)

(; doc: A set is bounded above if there exists an upper bound. ;)
(; //LEAN:BddAbove ;)
BddAbove : (s : Elem (powerset x)) -> Prop.

(; doc: Turn a predicate `p : α → Prop` into a set, also written as `{x | p x}` ;)
(; //LEAN:Set.ofPred ;)
Set__ofPred : (Mem : (Elem x -> Prop)) -> Elem (powerset x).

